# Private/internal docs: ignore ALL root-level markdown except the public keep-set.
# This is the reliable catch-all so no strategy/planning doc can be committed at root.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/design.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md

